
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
          integrity="sha384-EVSTQN3/azprG1Anm3QDgpJLIm9Nao0Yz1ztcQTwFspd3yD65VohhpuuCOmLASjC" crossorigin="anonymous" />
    <title>트리플에스 커뮤니티- 인기 글</title>
</head>
<body class="other-page">
{{>layout/header}}

<div class="container mt-4">
    <h2 class="mb-4">인기 글</h2>

<table class="table table-hover">
    <colgroup>
        <col style="width: 8%">
        <col style="width: 45%">
        <col style="width: 15%">
        <col style="width: 15%">
    </colgroup>
    <thead class="table-light">
    <tr>
        <th scope="col">글 순서</th>
        <th scopo="col">게시판</th>
        <th scope="col">닉네임</th>
        <th scope="col">제목</th>
        <th scope="col">작성 날짜</th>
        <th scope="col">추천 수</th>
    </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody class="table-article">
    {{#articleList}}
        <tr>
            <th scope="row">{{id}}</th>
            <td>{{categoryName}}</td>
            <td>{{userId}}</td>
            <td><a href="/{{category}}/{{id}}">{{title}}</a></td>
            <td>{{formattedDate}}</td>
            <td>{{likesCount}}</td>
        </tr>
    {{/articleList}}

    {{^articleList}}
        <p>아직 인기글이 없습니다.</p>
    {{/articleList}}
    </tbody>
</table>
</div>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>